# Excluded from the deployed plugin artifact.
#
# The artifact is built by copying the `beyond-elysium/` subfolder wholesale, so what ships is
# a directory. Everything that must never ship (the Grapevine source archive, the planning
# docs, tests, tooling, sample data) lives outside that subfolder and cannot reach the
# artifact by any path.
#
# `build/` and `vendor/` live inside the subfolder and ship - they are the compiled bundle
# and the Composer autoloader, gitignored but required at runtime.

# OS noise that can appear inside any directory, including the shippable one.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
